Steel Browser MACU overlay

This product includes software from Steel Browser
(https://github.com/steel-dev/steel-browser), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

The overlay modifies Steel's live-session-streamer template to add a
sanitized, versioned parent-frame lifecycle contract. The modification does
not include page URLs, session or page identifiers, credentials, WebSocket
endpoints, error text, or close codes in its lifecycle messages.
